From: Ezra Kruger <ekruges@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 01:32:23 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/7] decorations: titlebar buttons + double-click fullscreen
 for floating windows

New deco_buttons module draws close / iconify / maximize glyphs on the
left of floating titlebars using the existing titlebar text color, and
route_click() hit-tests them before resize/drag handling. Iconify uses
the scratchpad, maximize toggles fullscreen. Double-clicking the
titlebar toggles fullscreen, the classic floating-WM behavior.
